{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0554_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0554_1000_p", "source_sha256": "75a1b1116ae2824b7e4fd0f10154764597ef41f1e19c3e7cbe6984b367a74aaf", "ja": "（ゴースト退治のシスターたちが活躍するドラマに\n琴葉とあずささんが抜擢された。撮影は順調だ！）", "zh": "（琴叶和梓小姐被选中出演一部由消灭幽灵的修女们大显身手的电视剧。拍摄进展顺利！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0554_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0554_1001_017kth", "source_sha256": "61daf8581eedc8373161b2f037f47112d3bd5be5683e533dfdc75986519eb34f", "ja": "あずさ先輩、ここは任せてください。\n悪いゴーストめ！　大人しく……ひゃああっ！？", "zh": "梓前辈，这里就交给我吧。\n可恶的幽灵！给我老实点……呀啊啊！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0554_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0554_1002_010azu", "source_sha256": "b76b567bc74e967707b221d46a35a77611efd1af4b05127319fa589c2746b4d1", "ja": "あらあら……。少しおいたが過ぎるみたいね。\nダメよ～。うふふふふ……。", "zh": "哎呀呀……看来有点太调皮了呢。\n这样可不行哦～。呵呵呵呵……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0554_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0554_1003_p", "source_sha256": "c68dcf4431f261d4538c7b1c8d88f312b69f202030bedc7266ecd38540d65bd2", "ja": "琴葉、あずささん、お疲れさまです。\n次のシーンまで、休んでくださいね。", "zh": "琴叶、千早，辛苦了。\n到下一个场景前，先休息一下吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0554_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0554_1004_010azu", "source_sha256": "f39884cc12319421f2a7a76eaf7c9e86b475606ee864c04f8ce0a469b100817b", "ja": "ありがとうございます♪　……あ、あら？\n水筒の蓋が……んんっ……閉めすぎちゃったかしら。", "zh": "谢谢♪……啊，哎呀？\n水壶盖……唔……是不是拧得太紧了呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0554_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0554_1005_p", "source_sha256": "922a9f08f9383feddfbb91237bd7852193acd799601784882e61cf87d3304e94", "ja": "ちょっと貸してもらえますか？\nここは俺が……ぐおおお！　ダ、ダメだ……。", "zh": "能借我一下吗？\n这里就交给我……呜哦哦哦！不、不行……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0554_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0554_1006_017kth", "source_sha256": "c2ae4787880123bfb9416abcdf0631668d9eeedb7b52210e183b1f027fe11dc7", "ja": "{$P$}。\nそういう時は、濡らしたタオルを使うといいんです。", "zh": "{$P$}。\n这种时候，用湿毛巾比较好。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0554_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0554_1007_p", "source_sha256": "9ad3571ab4af7ef6a85ee0002ca68df82678b4a552de30bb6f0866e03f4ce1f9", "ja": "濡らしたタオル？", "zh": "湿毛巾？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0554_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0554_1008_017kth", "source_sha256": "a962182163f0a4c3a5a38e8653e172c15aaf32d42fc09ef295c040f1aed5cd41", "ja": "はい。こうやって、フタに巻いて……えいっ！", "zh": "对。像这样，包在盖子上……嘿！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0554_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0554_1009_se", "source_sha256": "9bce5ea25b46290e58b299d481d59b5ee3a9ccd01b47dd1e087537381f0678e3", "ja": "パカッ", "zh": "啪嗒", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0554_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0554_1010_p", "source_sha256": "de3e4165059422cf7f163b2cb2f5426450aeda9cba2fc542677729d55eb82167", "ja": "……おお、開いた！\n琴葉、よく知ってたな。こんな裏技。", "zh": "……哦哦，打开了！\n琴叶，你懂得挺多的嘛，居然还知道这种窍门。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0554_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0554_1011_017kth", "source_sha256": "117a88042115a2a5cf6dc6fe7d41b47bc194286a4cf212dc6f470ce8684efe4f", "ja": "水筒は私もよく使うので、調べたことがあったんです。\nお役に立てて良かった……。", "zh": "我也经常用水壶，所以之前查过相关资料。能帮上忙真是太好了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0554_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0554_1012_010azu", "source_sha256": "97fb3eb56f3114bedb8e6b2fb786910052b593ffd1768ade518bff366983ff90", "ja": "うふふっ。さすが琴葉ちゃん。\nしっかりしてるから、つい頼りにしてしまうのよね。", "zh": "呵呵，真不愧是琴叶。  \n因为她很可靠，所以总是不由得想依赖她呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0554_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0554_1013_p", "source_sha256": "8ca24ce38a1fb1c3a2a48148f301c8b81a7b173d93d28825a025a5d0757e6cfe", "ja": "そうですね。普段とは全然違う役だけど、\n琴葉がしっかり演じてくれるから、助かってるよ。", "zh": "是啊。虽然这是和琴叶平时完全不同的角色，但她认真演绎得很好，帮了我大忙。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0554_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0554_1014_017kth", "source_sha256": "50f50810a92c65951c4bded2217f17eef20342fe658395587d9142dc669f9500", "ja": "いえ。あずささんが相談にのってくれたおかげです。\n私ひとりだと、今も悩んでいたかもしれません。", "zh": "不，是多亏了梓小姐愿意听我商量。要是只有我一个人，说不定现在还在烦恼呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0554_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0554_1015_010azu", "source_sha256": "b0243c4d54720da9247dbab5bbc5cf6657978ed05a63ac3fcaa882805f5e0f77", "ja": "ふふっ、琴葉ちゃん本当に真剣な表情で、\n「ドジってどうすれば……」って悩んでいたから。", "zh": "呵呵，因为琴叶当时一脸认真地烦恼着：“总是出糗该怎么办……”", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0554_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0554_1016_010azu", "source_sha256": "02fac47f16a15bb4cbbc108021111868580fab3258f56abed89e89bc51325c2d", "ja": "思わず、声をかけちゃったのよね。\nついついおせっかいを焼いちゃって……。", "zh": "我就忍不住上去搭话了。\n一不小心就爱多管闲事了呢……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0554_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0554_1017_017kth", "source_sha256": "0ed0d5c901795738bab89d9fcc44d239764701821f06b046bb54a9202e46a8bb", "ja": "そんな……お節介だなんて！\n声をかけてもらえて、私、嬉しかったです。", "zh": "怎么会……怎么能说是多管闲事呢！\n你愿意主动和我说话，我真的很开心。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0554_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0554_1018_p", "source_sha256": "1e1e096bedaca15d353abfab50f0bd1dbdf660c075e10107aecb62d84d8329be", "ja": "なるほど。お互いを思い合っていたから、\n息ピッタリだったのか。まるでドラマの二人みたいだ。", "zh": "原来如此。因为彼此都在为对方着想，所以才会这么默契啊。简直就像电视剧里的两个人一样。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0554_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0554_1019_010azu", "source_sha256": "a6c17442c0ae10479c2ceefd0b240428110b6f187f7532b78f25950f481be1d8", "ja": "ふふっ、そうかもしれませんね。ですから……\n{$P$}さん？", "zh": "呵呵，也许真是这样呢。所以……{$P$}先生？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0554_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0554_1020_p", "source_sha256": "99ed698cbc505c5e33950f9031966ea4c09d37734db78af27d939927144a4dee", "ja": "？　なんでしょう、あずささん？", "zh": "？怎么了，梓小姐？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0554_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0554_1021_010azu", "source_sha256": "378057c85183c3dccc8b0cc02dee3a778341b50372674bc16b1d3dbe9c1247f9", "ja": "琴葉ちゃんへのおいたは許しませんよ？\n先ほど、監督さんと悪だくみしてましたよね～。", "zh": "我可不允许你欺负琴叶哦？\n刚才，你和导演先生在密谋什么吧～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0554_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0554_1022_017kth", "source_sha256": "342fcf4fed27efbba53b31ba344b2afe33e1bfe509e5e247e785c820b4113034", "ja": "えっ？　どういうことですか？\n{$P$}、もっと詳しく……。", "zh": "咦？这是怎么回事？\n{$P$}，请再详细说说……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0554_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0554_1023_p", "source_sha256": "de14b6194d8b1f282e271f8e0122147752e13f1dbf7f279a79000a5e309045ec", "ja": "えーっと……監督さんがもう少しセクシーな感じに\nと言ってて。も、もちろん断ったぞ！", "zh": "呃……导演说要再性感一点。所、所以我当然拒绝了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0554_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0554_1024_017kth", "source_sha256": "e7908f3bec9afb45a067886fe56e5748b4d5b5853c6078b6d80801516f4e2781", "ja": "本当ですか……？　もしウソなら、あずささんと一緒に\nこらしめちゃいますから。ふふっ♪", "zh": "真的吗……？要是骗我的话，我就和阿梓小姐一起好好教训你。呵呵♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
